RUN | $HOUSE/@.apps/deskopoly/ops/+x/deskopoly_chat.+x | $T/app | $T/c1 | as=p1 | amend 3 give 6
EXPECT_OUT | p1 amend: id=3;give=cash:6;get=-;round=1;amended | CHAT-5-amend
